      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Novelty avatars such as giant Kaiju or spaceship sized avatars certainly have a place on VRC so supporting these avatars should still happen.\n\nI feel if a world has an Udon set height limit then it should rescale the avatars, but if not, then setting the size wheel to 100% should snap the avatar back to its original size.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
