      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After further consideration I think the current behaviour is fine? (for the most part) It allows you to use the scaling, but only between the 5m max and 0.2m min height. But you can technically also be in your original bigger height.\n\nMy only grip really is that it's kinda hard / annoying to get back to your original height. As you currently need to either reset the entire Avatar or go through the Main Menu for it. \n\nTo improve this maybe consider making the 5m max a snapping point and once they are at it, they get set to original height instead of the 5m limit? Or adding a separate button to reset the Avatar Height if your Avatar is above the 5m or below the 2m limit.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
